            "certainty": "Likely",
            "description": "Wind with gusts between 15 and 20 m/s (55 to 70 km/h).\n\nPossible complications in the energy industry, forestry, and transport. Possible damage to trees and forests. Minor damage to energy infrastructure, property (especially older buildings). Risk of injury from flying or falling objects, especially broken branches. Minor travel delays due to debris and outages.",
