            "event": "Moderate Wind Related Impact",
            "eventCode": [
              {
                "value": "V.1",
                "valueName": "SIVS"
              }
            ],
            "expires": "2026-10-09T01:59:59+02:00",
            "instruction": "Secure windows, doors, remove or anchor loosely stored objects, tents, greenhouses, etc. Watch out for falling objects such as branches or roof tiles. When driving, watch out for strong crosswinds at exposed points such as bridges, drive slowly. In the mountains, limit hikes and avoid ridge areas in particular.",
